### ==========================================

### 5 User Login (เข้าสู่ระบบสมาชิก)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "chaiyapat8@gmail.com",
    "password": "Kokoku254808"
}

### 6 User Register / Signup (สมัครสมาชิก)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "chaiyapat9",
    "email": "chaiyapat9@gmail.com",
    "password": "Kokoku254808"
}

### 7 User Forgot Password (ลืมรหัสผ่านสมาชิก)
POST http://localhost:9091/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "chaiyapat8@gmail.com"
}

